              even more, especially if they are growing, conserving energy, or simply enjoying a
              quiet indoor routine.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-3">
          <span class="question-text">What should indoor cats have for enrichment?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="faq-3" hidden>
          <div class="details-inner">
            <p>
              Indoor cats benefit from scratching posts, climbing spots, window perches, puzzle
              feeders, and regular play sessions. Rotating toys and creating vertical space can help
              keep them mentally engaged and physically active.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-4">
          <span class="question-text">Why do cats knead blankets or laps?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="faq-4" hidden>
          <div class="details-inner">
            <p>
              Kneading is a comforting behavior that starts in kittenhood during nursing. Adult cats
              often keep the habit because it signals relaxation, familiarity, and a sense of safety
              in a favorite resting spot.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-5">
          <span class="question-text">How often should a litter box be cleaned?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="faq-5" hidden>
          <div class="details-inner">
            <p>
              Scoop at least once a day and change litter fully on a regular schedule based on the
              litter type and number of cats. A clean box supports good bathroom habits and can
              reduce stress-related avoidance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const toggles = document.querySelectorAll(".question");

